# URL of the deployed CreatorAI backend API (no trailing slash).
#
# LOCAL DEV: leave unset — api.ts falls back to http://127.0.0.1:8000.
# PRODUCTION (Vercel): set this in the Vercel dashboard to your Render URL, e.g.
#   VITE_API_URL=https://creatorai-api.onrender.com
#
# NOTE: This is NOT secret (it is baked into the public JS bundle), so never put
# passwords or keys here. Do not rename this file — commit it as documentation.
